	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Combat>Mk-V 作战</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Combat>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.StartWithMkV>开局赠送 Mk-V</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.StartWithMkV>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.StartWithMkV.Desc>新开局在玩家起始地图直接生成一台 Mk-V；只影响新游戏，不影响已有存档。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.StartWithMkV.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVCombatEnabled>自动作战</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVCombatEnabled>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVCombatEnabled.Desc>允许 Mk-V 自动索敌、开火和回舱；关闭后 Mk-V 只做家务，不主动交战。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVCombatEnabled.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVReturnToBay>脱战后回舱</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVReturnToBay>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVReturnToBay.Desc>目标离开交战范围后返回 Mk-V 组装舱；关闭后直接恢复家务。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVReturnToBay.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVAutoPickupWeapons>自动拾取武器</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVAutoPickupWeapons>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVAutoPickupWeapons.Desc>Mk-V 会寻找评分更高的远程武器并换装；关闭后只使用出生自带的电弧发射器。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVAutoPickupWeapons.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVEngageRange>交战范围</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVEngageRange>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVReturnRange>回舱判定距离</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVReturnRange>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVWeaponPickupRadius>武器拾取范围</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVWeaponPickupRadius>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVAttackSpeed>Mk-V 攻击速度</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVAttackSpeed>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVHitChance>Mk-V 命中率</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVHitChance>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVBayAutoStart>组装舱自动开工</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVBayAutoStart>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVBayAutoStart.Desc>材料、电力和研究都满足时，Mk-V 组装舱自动开始下一台；关闭后需要手动点击开始。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVBayAutoStart.Desc>

