	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVSolarCharging.Desc>Mk-V 在露天且光照达到阈值时被动充电。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVSolarCharging.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVWindCharging>风能充电</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVWindCharging>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVWindCharging.Desc>Mk-V 在露天且风速达到阈值时被动充电。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVWindCharging.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVSolarEfficiency>太阳能效率</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.MkVSolarEfficiency>
