	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Maintenance>维护与表现</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Maintenance>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DurabilityHint>普通机器人耐久上限 1000，Mk-V 为 1800。只有受到伤害时才会损耗（约 250 点伤害报废），日常工作不损耗；耐久为 0 时报废成钢和零部件，殖民者可在「建造」工作中维修。维修期间机器人不会充电，修完才恢复充电。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DurabilityHint>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds>滴滴声</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds.Desc>机器人工作时偶尔发出提示音；低电时只提醒一次。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow>充电光效</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow.Desc>机器人对接充电时，充电桩发出淡蓝色光。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow.Desc>

